So this is the first day of me creating a linux project. So basically, this project is to check the system of our hardware.
The first thing i will do, is to create system-info. later dude.

The system info will included info about the hardware we use, such as :
- Hostname (done)
- Operating system (done)
- Kernel version (done)
- CPU information (done)
- RAM usage
- Disk usage
- Uptime
- Current user
- IP addresses
- Default gateway 
